### Desktop apps using C++/WinRT

For a desktop app, instead of calling the [UserConsentVerifier.RequestVerificationAsync](/en-us/uwp/api/windows.security.credentials.ui.userconsentverifier.requestverificationasync) method, you'll need to:

*   First obtain the handle to the window that will request the verification. See [Retrieve a window handle (HWND)](/en-us/windows/apps/develop/ui-input/retrieve-hwnd) for details on how to do this for the Windows UI Library (WinUI) 3.
